le's average\n    for pile in piles:\n        xs = [x for x, y in pile]\n        ys = [y for x, y in pile]\n        centroids.append((round(sum(xs) / len(xs), 1), round(sum(ys) / len(ys), 1)))\n    print(\"step\", step, \"centroids\", centroids)\n"}